@startuml tb-state
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Lucida Grande"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFCE
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
  ArrowColor #000000
  FontColor #000000
  AttributeFontColor #000000
  StereotypeFontColor #000000
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
}
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 그림 7-5 대응 — State (예약 생애주기) / Context=Reservation
class Reservation <<Context>> {
  -currentState: ReservationState
  --
  +enterPassengerInfo()
  +processPayment()
  +issueTicket()
  +setState(ReservationState): void
}
interface ReservationState <<State>> {
  +name(): String
  +enterPassengerInfo(ctx)
  +processPayment(ctx)
  +issueTicket(ctx)
  +requestCancellation(ctx)
  +confirmCancellation(ctx)
  +requestRefund(ctx)
  +handlePaymentFailure(ctx)
  +processRefundDecision(ctx)
}
class InitiatedState <<State1>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class PendingPaymentState <<State2>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class ConfirmedState <<State3>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class TicketedState <<State4>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class CancellationRequestedState <<State5>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class CancelledState <<State6>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class RefundRequestedState <<State7>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
class RefundedState <<State8>> {
  +name(): String
  +(허용 전이만 override)
}
Reservation o--> ReservationState : -currentState
ReservationState <|.. InitiatedState
ReservationState <|.. PendingPaymentState
ReservationState <|.. ConfirmedState
ReservationState <|.. TicketedState
ReservationState <|.. CancellationRequestedState
ReservationState <|.. CancelledState
ReservationState <|.. RefundRequestedState
ReservationState <|.. RefundedState
note top of ReservationState
  iter4 정합: 그림처럼 중간 abstract 층(AbstractReservationState) 제거 →
  <color:red>interface 가 8개 구체 상태와 직접 1:n</color>
end note
legend bottom
  <#FFFFCE>|= 표기 |= 의미 |
  |<#FFFFCE> 노란 박스 | iteration 1-3 기존 |
  | <color:red>빨강 테두리/글자</color> | iteration 4 신규/수정 |
endlegend
@enduml